{"pageProps":{"lesson":{"day":23,"title":"Day 23: Events in order — SpeakSprint","heading":"Events in order","kicker":"DAY 23 · 30 MINUTES · 6 SESSIONS / WEEK","description":"Kể sự kiện theo trình tự dễ hiểu.","contentVersion":2,"answers":{"comp":"a|b|a","quiz":"a|b"},"sections":[{"id":"mission","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">MISSION · 1 MIN</span><h2>Today's mission</h2><p>Tell a short work story in a clear order. Speak for <b>120 seconds</b>, using at least <b>3 of today’s 5 chunks</b>. Say it first; write only brief notes.</p><p class=\"instruction\">5 chunk mỗi ngày · tối đa 5 chunk mới. Ngày tổng kết ôn lại chunk đã học.</p>"},{"id":"warmup","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">RECALL · 3 MIN</span><h2>Warm-up recall</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Recall before opening today’s chunk cards. Ôn theo mốc bài học +1, +3, +7, +14; mỗi lần chọn vài chunk để giữ bài gọn.</p><p class=\"recall-source\">Day 22 · ôn sau 1 bài</p><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"old\"><p>Describe the outcome of past work. <small>Say one sentence from memory.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-warm-1\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-1\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"The result was that users could find the menu faster.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-warm-1-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-1-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-1-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><p class=\"recall-source\">Day 20 · ôn sau 3 bài</p><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"old\"><p>Clarify something you said earlier. <small>Use it in a different project or situation.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-warm-2\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-2\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-2\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"What I mean is that we should test with one small team.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-warm-2-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-2-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-2-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><p class=\"recall-source\">Day 16 · ôn sau 7 bài</p><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"old\"><p>Give the strongest reason for your opinion. <small>Say two connected sentences aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-warm-3\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-3\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-3\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"The main reason is that shorter meetings save time.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-warm-3-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-3-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-3-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><p class=\"recall-source\">Day 9 · ôn sau 14 bài</p><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"old\"><p>Explain a consequence of the problem. <small>Answer as if a colleague has just asked you.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-warm-4\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-4\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-4\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"As a result, customers have to wait longer.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-warm-4-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-4-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-4-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div>"},{"id":"reading","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">INPUT · 4 MIN</span><h2>Read, listen to your own voice, and notice</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Read once for meaning. Then read aloud; on the second pass, notice how the speaker uses whole phrases.</p><div class=\"reading\">Last week, we had a problem with the service. First, the system sent an alert while I was checking messages. Next, I opened the logs and checked the server. We found that the disk was full. After that, I asked a colleague which files we could safely remove. Then, we made a copy and removed the old temporary files. Finally, the service returned to normal. The result was a shorter wait for customers. I shared the details with our team so everyone knew what happened. We decided to check the disk regularly to avoid the same problem.</div>"},{"id":"comprehension","className":"panel","type":"assessment","prefix":"comp","label":"COMPREHENSION · 3 MIN","heading":"Check the message","hint":"Look for who, what happened, and why the speaker says it.","questions":[{"prompt":"1. What is the speaker describing?","choices":[{"text":" The order of actions during an incident","name":"comp-1","value":"a","saveKey":"v2-comp1"},{"text":" A normal customer survey","name":"comp-1","value":"b","saveKey":"v2-comp1"}]},{"prompt":"2. What was wrong with the server?","choices":[{"text":" The calendar was missing","name":"comp-2","value":"a","saveKey":"v2-comp2"},{"text":" The disk was full","name":"comp-2","value":"b","saveKey":"v2-comp2"}]},{"prompt":"3. Why check the disk regularly now?","choices":[{"text":" To avoid the same problem","name":"comp-3","value":"a","saveKey":"v2-comp3"},{"text":" To delay the next release","name":"comp-3","value":"b","saveKey":"v2-comp3"}]}]},{"id":"chunks","className":"panel","type":"chunks","label":"CHUNKS · 5 MIN","heading":"Five chunks to use today","instruction":"Learn the whole phrase. Change the details to fit your work. Mở từng thẻ khi cần; sau đó nhìn đi chỗ khác và nói lại.","items":[{"label":"1/5 · Luyện hôm nay","phrase":"First, I…","meaning":"Đầu tiên…","details":["Begin a story about a sequence of events.","First, + past-tense clause","First, I saw an alert.","First, I checked the message from the system."],"saveKey":"chunk-v1-used-1"},{"label":"2/5 · Luyện hôm nay","phrase":"Next, I…","meaning":"Tiếp theo…","details":["Introduce the next action in a story.","Next, + past-tense clause","Next, I checked the server.","Next, I asked a colleague to check the settings."],"saveKey":"chunk-v1-used-2"},{"label":"3/5 · Luyện hôm nay","phrase":"After that, I…","meaning":"Sau đó…","details":["Move on to a later event.","After that, + past-tense clause","After that, I called the team.","After that, we found some old files on the server."],"saveKey":"chunk-v1-used-3"},{"label":"4/5 · Luyện hôm nay","phrase":"Then, I…","meaning":"Rồi…","details":["Link another action in the same sequence.","Then, + past-tense clause","Then, I removed the old files.","Then, we tested the service together."],"saveKey":"chunk-v1-used-4"},{"label":"5/5 · Luyện hôm nay","phrase":"Finally, we…","meaning":"Cuối cùng…","details":["Describe the final event or outcome.","Finally, + past-tense clause","Finally, we fixed the page.","Finally, we got the service working again."],"saveKey":"chunk-v1-used-5"}]},{"id":"variation","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">VARIATION · 4 MIN</span><h2>Change it, then make it yours</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Say each answer first, then type a short sentence. Two quick variations per chunk; keep the same pattern.</p><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>1. First, I…</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-1-a\">A. Use this idea: notice a slow page.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-1-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-1-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-1-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-1-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-1-b\"></div><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>2. Next, I…</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-2-a\">A. Use this idea: open the error logs.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-2-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-2-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-2-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-2-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-2-b\"></div><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>3. After that, I…</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-3-a\">A. Use this idea: make a copy of the files.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-3-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-3-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-3-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-3-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-3-b\"></div><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>4. Then, I…</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-4-a\">A. Use this idea: restart the app.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-4-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-4-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-4-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-4-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-4-b\"></div><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>5. Finally, we…</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-5-a\">A. Use this idea: send an update to the team.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-5-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-5-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-5-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-5-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-5-b\"></div>"},{"id":"rapid-recall","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">RAPID RECALL · 3 MIN</span><h2>Recall in about three seconds</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Look away from the chunk cards. Try to start speaking within 3 seconds, then type what you said. A model appears only after an attempt; other natural answers are possible.</p><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>Begin a story about a sequence of events. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"First, I checked the message from the system.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>Introduce the next action in a story. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"Next, I asked a colleague to check the settings.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>Move on to a later event. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"After that, we found some old files on the server.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>Link another action in the same sequence. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"Then, we tested the service together.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>Describe the final event or outcome. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"Finally, the service returned to normal.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"old\"><p>Start a short account of last week's work. <small>Say one sentence from memory.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"Last week, I talked to five customers.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div>"},{"id":"speaking","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">SPEAK · 5 MIN</span><h2>Make the language yours</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Read aloud three times. Follow the pauses marked by / and emphasize the important words.</p><div class=\"shadow\">First, I saw an alert. /<br>Next, I checked the server. /<br>After that, I called the team.</div><p><b>Speaking challenge:</b> Tell a short work story in a clear order.</p><p class=\"instruction\">Speak for 120 seconds. Use at least 3 chunks. Notes only: your situation · two details · a reason or problem · your next step. Do not write a full script first.</p><textarea id=\"speaking-response\" data-save=\"speaking\" placeholder=\"Nói thành tiếng trước, rồi nhập lại ít nhất 8 từ bạn đã nói…\"></textarea><div class=\"row\"><button id=\"speaking-done\">Tôi đã nói thành tiếng</button><span id=\"status-speaking\">Chưa hoàn thành</span></div><div id=\"speak-feedback\" class=\"feedback\"></div>"},{"id":"conversation","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">CONVERSATION · 3 MIN</span><h2>A real work conversation</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Practise with a partner, or take both roles aloud. Your partner is a coworker. Open one question, answer it, then continue. Khi luyện cùng Codex, yêu cầu đóng vai đồng nghiệp và hỏi từng câu; trang này không có AI trò chuyện trực tiếp.</p><details class=\"conversation-turn\"><summary>Colleague · question 1</summary><p>What did you finish recently?</p></details><details class=\"conversation-turn\"><summary>Colleague · question 2</summary><p>What happened during the work?</p></details><details class=\"conversation-turn\"><summary>Colleague · question 3</summary><p>What did you learn?</p></details><details class=\"conversation-turn\"><summary>Colleague · question 4</summary><p>What are you planning next?</p></details><p class=\"instruction\">After 4 exchanges, choose at most 3 useful corrections. Say the improved sentences once more.</p>"},{"id":"quiz","className":"panel","type":"assessment","prefix":"quiz","label":"END CHECK · 2 MIN","heading":"Choose a useful chunk","hint":"Think about the situation where you would use the phrase.","questions":[{"prompt":"1. Begin a story about a sequence of events.","choices":[{"text":" First, I…","name":"quiz-1","value":"a","saveKey":"v2-quiz1"},{"text":" Then, I…","name":"quiz-1","value":"b","saveKey":"v2-quiz1"}]},{"prompt":"2. Describe the final event or outcome.","choices":[{"text":" Next, I…","name":"quiz-2","value":"a","saveKey":"v2-quiz2"},{"text":" Finally, we…","name":"quiz-2","value":"b","saveKey":"v2-quiz2"}]}]},{"id":"daily-progress","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">REVIEW · 2 MIN</span><h2>Today's progress</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Các số về nói và nhớ chunk là tự đánh giá; số câu đọc hiểu lấy từ lần nộp gần nhất. Chưa nhập nghĩa là chưa có dữ liệu.</p><p id=\"chunk-progress\" role=\"status\"></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-seconds\">Actual speaking time (seconds):</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"number\" id=\"chunk-v1-seconds\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-seconds\" min=\"0\" max=\"600\" step=\"1\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-improvement\">One thing I can do better now:</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-improvement\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-improvement\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-next\">Tomorrow, one small thing I will practise:</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-next\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-next\">"}],"completionText":"Hoàn thành đọc hiểu, kể lần một, quiz và các bước Recall → Think → đối chiếu → kể lần hai. Nhiều bài trong cùng ngày chỉ tính một ngày streak.","navigation":[{"href":"../index.html","text":"← Dashboard"},{"href":"day-24.html","text":"Day 24 →"}]},"pageType":"lesson"},"__N_SSG":true}